# niyama.cyr -- bundled distribution
# Version: 1.0.0
# Status:  v1.0.0 — fold-ready release. Public API surface locked
#                per ADR 0010 (Surface freeze). Per ADR 0011 (Fold
#                readiness and post-v1.0 fold trigger), v1.0 ships
#                fold-READY but does not actually fold at this
#                release: cyrius stdlib will vendor this file as
#                `lib/niyama.cyr` byte-identical once a second
#                long-horizon AGNOS-lineage consumer materializes
#                (cyim is consumer #1; gate per ADR 0001).
#                niyama-the-repo enters maintenance mode at v1.0;
#                v1.x patches are bug-fix only. Post-fold extensions
#                land in the stdlib-vendored copy.
#
# Fold-ready single-include artifact. Following the sandhi precedent
# (cyrius v5.7.0 vendored `dist/sandhi.cyr` byte-identical as
# `lib/sandhi.cyr`), once niyama hits v1.0 with multi-consumer
# adoption, cyrius stdlib will vendor this file as `lib/niyama.cyr`
# per niyama ADR 0001.
#
# Until then, downstream consumers can vendor this file directly via
# `[deps.niyama]` in their cyrius.cyml. Consumers must ALSO include
# the Unicode stdlib pieces niyama leans on (cyrius >= 5.8.65):
#   include "lib/str.cyr"
#   include "lib/unicode/categories.cyr"
#   include "lib/unicode/casefold.cyr"
#   include "lib/unicode/normalize.cyr"
#
# Engines shipped:
#   - bre   (M1, v0.2.0):   POSIX BRE — niyama_bre_*
#                           v0.7.0 adds GNU \<\> word boundaries +
#                           POSIX bracket classes [[:alpha:]] etc.
#   - re2   (M2, v0.3.0):   ERE flavor + linear-time guarantee at API.
#                           niyama_re2_* — same shape as niyama_bre_*,
#                           with compile-time rejection of
#                           backref / lookaround / atomic / recursion.
#                           v0.7.0 adds named captures + inline flags
#                           (?i)(?m)(?s) + spec-strict ^/$/.
#                           defaults.
#                           v0.8.0 adds \p{L} Unicode property classes,
#                           multi-byte literal pattern chars (UCHAR),
#                           and (?i) Unicode case folding (UCHAR_CI).
#   - pcre  (M3, v0.4.0):   Perl-compat backtracking matcher.
#                           niyama_pcre_* — backref, lookahead, atomic,
#                           named captures, possessive quantifiers.
#                           Catastrophic-backtracking mitigated by
#                           configurable step-limit + recursion-depth
#                           bound (per ADR 0004).
#                           v0.7.0 adds POSIX bracket classes, inline
#                           flags, \K, branch-reset, conditional
#                           patterns, callouts, and spec-strict ^/$/.
#                           defaults.
#                           v0.8.0 adds \p{L}, (?i) Unicode case fold,
#                           fixed-width lookbehind (?<=)/(?<!), and
#                           recursion (?R) / (?P>NAME).
#   - fuzzy (M3.5, v0.5.0): Levenshtein edit-distance matcher.
#                           niyama_fuzzy_* — anchored match + substring
#                           + prefix modes. Not regex. Per ADR 0005.
#                           v0.8.0 adds FUZZY_FLAG_UNICODE_NFD and
#                           exact start-position recovery in _search.
#   - vim   (M4, v0.6.0):   vim/cyim flavor Pike NFA matcher.
#                           niyama_vim_* — all 4 magicness modes,
#                           \<\> boundaries, \zs/\ze markers, POSIX
#                           bracket classes [[:alpha:]] etc.
#                           Per ADR 0006.
#                           v0.8.0 adds \p{L} and folds POSIX-class
#                           code onto src/posix_classes.cyr.
#
# Shared modules:
#   - posix_classes (v0.7.0): ASCII fillers + name-recognizer for the
#                             12 POSIX bracket classes. Used by bre,
#                             pcre, AND vim (vim folded onto it at
#                             v0.8.0 per ADR 0008).
#   - unicode_props (v0.8.0): \p{NAME} parser + 30-bit GeneralCategory
#                             mask lookup. Used by re2, pcre, vim.
#                             Backed by stdlib lib/unicode/categories.
#
# Next: v0.8.x (bre/vim backref decision-gated slot — pinned per
#       ladder rule; collapses to a CHANGELOG note if "no"), then M5
#       hardening + surface freeze, then v1.0 fold-ready release.
#
# Precondition: consumers MUST call alloc_init() before any
# niyama_*_compile() call.
#
# Do not edit -- rebuild with: scripts/build-dist.sh (post-M1)

var NIYAMA_VERSION = "1.0.0";

# === posix bracket classes (shared) ==================================
include "src/posix_classes.cyr"

# === unicode property classes (shared) ===============================
include "src/unicode_props.cyr"

# === bre engine ======================================================
include "src/bre.cyr"

# === re2 engine ======================================================
include "src/re2.cyr"

# === pcre engine =====================================================
include "src/pcre.cyr"

# === fuzzy engine ====================================================
include "src/fuzzy.cyr"

# === vim engine ======================================================
include "src/vim.cyr"
